File: ChangeLog.md

=======================================================================
Section 1 (v4.0.0-beta, end of ## Added)
OLD_SECTION
- CShapes rectangles take `config.radius` for rounded corners, ...

NEW_SECTION
- CShapes rectangles take `config.radius` for rounded corners, ...
- SPAEngine mounts a route only once the stylesheets its fragments carry have loaded: ...
- SPAEngine `config.styleTimeout`: the longest, in milliseconds, a fragment waits ...

REASON
Release-facing record of the new behaviour and config property.

=======================================================================
Section 2 (v4.0.0-beta, end of ## Fixed)
OLD_SECTION
- `$$.sm(el).animate()` no longer starts below its start value: ...

NEW_SECTION
- `$$.sm(el).animate()` no longer starts below its start value: ...
- SPAEngine no longer paints a fragment before its stylesheets arrive: ...
- SPAEngine flush selectors are emptied when the new route is mounted, ...
- SPAEngine: after back/forward, clicking the link that last loaded the content node loads its route again; ...
- SPAEngine: when two clicks race, only the last one is mounted; ...
- SPAEngine: a section that fails to fetch is logged and skipped, ...

REASON
Release-facing record of the bugs this change fixes, written from the consumer's side.
